sequenceDiagram
actor Admin as Admin
participant AdminSystemConsole as Boundary: AdminSystemConsole
participant GovernanceControl as Control: GovernanceControl
participant SystemLog as Entity: SystemLog
Admin->>AdminSystemConsole: Request operational status or work
AdminSystemConsole->>GovernanceControl: Apply trust and capacity controls
GovernanceControl->>SystemLog: Load governance evidence
SystemLog-->>GovernanceControl: Return checksums, digests and status
GovernanceControl-->>AdminSystemConsole: Execute only approved bounded work
AdminSystemConsole-->>Admin: Display safe audit result
